(text "V6 CIRCUIT STUDY ONLY: replaces V4 LT1963 stage. No PCB/main adoption.\nU8/fuse input protection and GPIO sheet remain separate V4 interfaces.\n30V buck input rating removes dependency on typical OVLO delay for U2/U7 INPUT ratings.\nIt does NOT guarantee output transient, USB current, startup or suspend compliance." (at 20 15 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left)) (uuid 64dac7e1-2190-5c81-b8fc-58fa798d9f2e))
