(text "RT intentionally floating: normal switching frequency450..550kHz. Dropout/PFM folding separate.\nFB nominal4.0V; static reference/resistor extrema3.9137..4.0865V, excluding FB bias/ripple/transients.\nC140/C141 exact MPN, effective capacitance and compensation review OPEN.\nU8 downstream raw-domain capacitors must be >=35V; C124 remains50V.\nNo direct tie of EN to raw VIN: EN absolute maximum6V.\nC199 is reserved for separate ADC_AVDD work; no reference collision." (at 20 225 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left)) (uuid 2f2a8072-3707-57a6-b8c8-a749132aa37c))
